    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B12_R0027",
      "english": "My name is %s.{LB}You are %s? Noted.{LB}Come back anytime!{PAD}",
      "context": "Tavern hostess introduction"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B12_R0028",
      "english": "%s?{LB}What a nice name.{LB}My name is %s.{PAD}",
      "context": "Tavern hostess introduction"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B12_R0029",
      "english": "Are you wealthy?{LB}How enviable.{LB}Someday, a good match{LB}will bring me happiness.{PAD}",
      "context": "Tavern hostess small talk"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B12_R0031",
      "english": "Sorry,{LB}home calls early today.{LB}My siblings are waiting.{PAD}",
      "context": "Tavern hostess small talk"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B12_R0032",
      "english": "Sleeping drunks{LB}are trouble.{PAD}",
      "context": "Tavern hostess small talk"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B12_R0033",
      "english": "Sailors risk their lives...{LB}How admirable.{LB}My parents deserve{LB}an easier life too.{PAD}",
      "context": "Tavern hostess small talk"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B12_R0034",
      "english": "My age?{LB}How old do you think?{PAD}",
      "context": "Tavern hostess small talk"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B12_R0036",
      "english": "Such an expensive gift?{LB}Thank you!{PAD}",
      "context": "Tavern hostess receives a gift"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B12_R0037",
      "english": "Thank you.{LB}No need to overdo it.{PAD}",
      "context": "Tavern hostess receives a gift"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B12_R0038",
      "english": "Calling me Venus?{LB}Hee hee...{LB}That sounds rather nice.{PAD}",
      "context": "Tavern hostess reacts to a gift"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B12_R0039",
      "english": "Come, drink and celebrate!{PAD}",
      "context": "Tavern hostess invitation"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B12_R0040",
      "english": "On holidays,{LB}a garden walk{LB}among flowers and trees{LB}cleanses the heart.{PAD}",
      "context": "Tavern hostess small talk"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B12_R0041",
      "english": "Pie is ready.{LB}Have some.{PAD}",
      "context": "Tavern hostess small talk"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B12_R0042",
      "english": "Cheap people are awful.{LB}You are not like that, right?{PAD}",
      "context": "Tavern hostess small talk"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B12_R0043",
      "english": "La la la...{LB}A woman waits for her{LB}lover to return from sea.{LB}Loving a sailor is hard...{PAD}",
      "context": "Tavern hostess song"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B12_R0044",
      "english": "Tell me{LB}of distant lands.{PAD}",
      "context": "Tavern hostess small talk"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B12_R0045",
      "english": "This city is wonderful.{LB}Always so lively!{LB}Gloomy cities depress me.{PAD}",
      "context": "Tavern hostess small talk"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B12_R0046",
      "english": "Ancient ruins sound fun.{LB}Seeing how people{LB}once lived{LB}feels romantic.{PAD}",
      "context": "Tavern hostess small talk"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B12_R0047",
      "english": "Some ignore fashion.{LB}Walking beside them{LB}would be embarrassing.{PAD}",
      "context": "Tavern hostess small talk"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B12_R0048",
      "english": "You are wonderful:{LB}strong and kind...{PAD}",
      "context": "Tavern hostess small talk"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B12_R0049",
      "english": "Something troubles you?{LB}Shall the cards reveal it?{LB}Oh, nothing is wrong?{PAD}",
      "context": "Tavern hostess small talk"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B13_R0008",
      "english": "What a fresh afternoon.{LB}Let us open a window.{PAD}",
      "context": "Tavern hostess small talk"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B13_R0009",
      "english": "Romance interests me little.{LB}Call me childish,{LB}but celebrating with{LB}everyone is more fun.{PAD}",
      "context": "Tavern hostess small talk"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B13_R0010",
      "english": "Mama always worked here.{LB}She was the most popular.{LB}Someday, with hard work,{LB}her fame will be mine!{PAD}",
      "context": "Tavern hostess small talk"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B13_R0011",
      "english": "Cooking is such fun.{LB}Seeing you enjoy{LB}what was prepared{LB}brings the greatest joy.{PAD}",
      "context": "Tavern hostess small talk"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B13_R0012",
      "english": "Everyone likes my songs.{LB}Helping Mama matters.{LB}Since Papa left,{LB}she never stops working...{PAD}",
      "context": "Tavern hostess small talk"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B13_R0013",
      "english": "Distant lands call to me.{LB}A vast unseen castle,{LB}a handsome foreign prince...{LB}Oh my!{PAD}",
      "context": "Tavern hostess small talk"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B13_R0014",
      "english": "Never love a sailor.{LB}Waiting without knowing{LB}when he will return...{LB}Yet love makes us weak.{PAD}",
      "context": "Tavern hostess small talk"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B13_R0015",
      "english": "Dull people are no good.{LB}Would that every sailor{LB}were as clever as you.{PAD}",
      "context": "Tavern hostess small talk"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B13_R0016",
      "english": "A woman's admired years{LB}are terribly brief.{LB}There is never time{LB}to neglect one's beauty.{PAD}",
      "context": "Tavern hostess small talk"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B13_R0017",
      "english": "Watching a fight fires me up!{LB}Perhaps my blood runs hot?{PAD}",
      "context": "Tavern hostess small talk"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B13_R0018",
      "english": "Luxury means little,{LB}but since childhood,{LB}princesses fascinated me.{PAD}",
      "context": "Tavern hostess small talk"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B13_R0019",
      "english": "Caring for my siblings{LB}is no burden. Still,{LB}marrying wealth could free us{LB}from this life someday.{PAD}",
      "context": "Tavern hostess small talk"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B13_R0020",
      "english": "Men are so simple.{LB}A little flattery{LB}goes right to their heads.{LB}Does that make women sly?{PAD}",
      "context": "Tavern hostess small talk"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B13_R0021",
      "english": "A passionate love sounds nice.{LB}Where is the right person?{PAD}",
      "context": "Tavern hostess small talk"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B13_R0023",
      "english": "Guests from afar are hard.{LB}Each land speaks differently.{LB}You understand{LB}my words, right?{PAD}",
      "context": "Tavern hostess small talk"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B13_R0024",
      "english": "Thanks for coming often.{LB}A drink is free today.{LB}Relax and enjoy it.{PAD}",
      "context": "Tavern hostess rewards a regular"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B13_R0025",
      "english": "Sailing sounds fun.{LB}This work is nice too,{LB}with many tales to hear.{PAD}",
      "context": "Tavern hostess small talk"
